WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.005
The two dogs barked and barked.

2
00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:13.205
"Go away!" Tom yelled.

3
00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:17.109
He hissed.

4
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:21.576
Suddenly— brring!

5
00:00:21.577 --> 00:00:23.610
Brring! A bell

6
00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:26.783
rang. A man rode a bicycle through the

7
00:00:26.784 --> 00:00:35.467
alley. The dogs got scared and ran

8
00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.282
away. "Whew!" Tom

9
00:00:38.283 --> 00:00:42.055
said. "Quick! Let's go

10
00:00:42.056 --> 00:00:53.926
home." The kittens ran out of the

11
00:00:53.927 --> 00:00:56.872
alley. They saw a wagon near a

12
00:00:56.873 --> 00:00:59.594
shop. Mittens

13
00:00:59.595 --> 00:01:02.258
gasped. "It's the farmer!" she

14
00:01:02.259 --> 00:01:08.881
said. "Let's go!" Tom

15
00:01:08.882 --> 00:01:17.737
said. The kittens ran as fast as they

16
00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:20.469
could. They jumped onto the farmer's wagon.

17
00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:26.137
