26
00:02:21.591 --> 00:02:27.267
"Did you have fun outside today?" Mrs. Twitchit said.

27
00:02:27.268 --> 00:02:30.597
"Yes," Moppet said.

28
00:02:30.598 --> 00:02:33.397
"No," Mittens said.

29
00:02:33.398 --> 00:02:37.319
"What about you, Tom?" Mrs. Twitchit asked.

30
00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.877
But Tom did not answer.

31
00:02:39.878 --> 00:02:52.807
He was sound asleep!

